From: Kamil Monicz <kamil@monicz.dev>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 06:50:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Expose exact H3 projection carriers and preserve grid
 traversal

Based on HydroniumLabs/h3o fa1557fd1edd56f64e4da95b2fd294609ce2353e (0.11.0). Expose the unrounded lattice, projection and seam inputs consumed by Gometry certificates. Preserve unfused coordinate decisions on the x86-64-v2 baseline, account for accumulated unit-vector rounding in debug diagnostics, avoid excessive disk preallocation and correct fast-ring iterator length bounds. Keep upstream code and tests unchanged otherwise.
